1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,340
Now I stand up slow on gummy legs and find my balance first

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,940
Take a little inventory, what's new, what's better, what's worse

3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:11,380
My legs might wobble, and my balance might be shy

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:15,060
But I'll stand up and say it in whatever body I've got

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,660
Some mornings it's a short list, some mornings it runs long

6
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:22,260
But I've never had a morning yet I couldn't put a yes on

7
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:25,860
'Cause yes don't mean I like it, and yes don't mean it's fun

8
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:29,540
Yes means I'm here for it, every second, every one

9
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:33,140
I don't know what today is gonna bring

10
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:37,460
But I'm saying yes to every single thing

11
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:42,180
Feet on the floor, arms in the air

12
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,620
To the good, to the bad, to whatever's out there

13
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:49,220
Yes, loud enough for the universe to hear

14
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:52,100
I choose this life (yes)

15
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,860
I choose this life (yes)

16
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:56,260
Yes, yes

17
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:59,540
Shout it, yes, yes, yes

18
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,140
Say it with me
